iously to give itself the best chance possible of winning gold at Nationals. Unfortunately, the intense environment has some of the new recruits discouraged and intimidated.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-04-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iPytTguViqvxYmcWns853om5taU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iPytTguViqvxYmcWns853om5taU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62564/season/3/episode/3"},{"id":"5213989","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The day of the Sunrise Festival finally arrives, and it's time for the concert band to have their first performance of the year. Proximity to other schools and bands brings some of Motomu's family issues to light.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-04-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ll6O7olWmPZzYlcwKEIsGvl9rSK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ll6O7olWmPZzYlcwKEIsGvl9rSK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62564/season/3/episode/4"},{"id":"5213990","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Now that she's well into her third-year, Kumiko is now facing pressure from teachers and parents alike to choose what she's doing after high school. Concert band members form groups to attend the Agata Festival, but Kumiko has other plans.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-05-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":8.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4ytU0zZNRExususNcynvSVdINZU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4ytU0zZNRExususNcynvSVdINZU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/62564/season/3/episod